{"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Guides","anchor":"Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/AutomaticTracking","doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/SessionsAndStandardContext","doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/ConsentGating","doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/PersistingRecords","doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/DefiningEvents","doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/TrackingPlanWorkflow"]}],"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep a seeded fraction of the events a tracker tracks, event by event or a whole session at once."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/traffluent\/samplingevents"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/SamplingEvents"},"metadata":{"role":"article","modules":[{"name":"Traffluent"}],"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Sampling Events"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sampling lives in module "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", and sampling by session uses "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". Nothing is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sampled until the app gives the tracker its samplers:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import Sessions","","struct Scrolled: Event {","    var offset: Int","}","","let tracker = Tracker(","    enrichers: [.sessions()],","    samplers: [.events(of: Scrolled.self, rate: 0.1), .sessions(rate: 0.5)]",")","tracker.track(Scrolled(offset: 120))  \/\/ if kept, its record's context[SampleRateKey.self]?.value is 0.05"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"Samplers","